      "message": "Oh, and looking at https://b.corp.google.com/issues/332977378#comment11, the `HARDWARE_NOT_YET_AVAILABLE(-85)` error code makes me hopeful that part a) might be all that\u0027s needed -- the HMAC key should only used for verifying auth tokens, which isn\u0027t relevant at boot time.",
